## Summary counts

- Regression cohort: **61 included / 61 total** (all rows with `status==ok` in `cohort_regression.csv`).
- Classification cohort: **16 included / 17 total** (`status==ok` in `cohort_classification.csv`).
- QUARTZ datasets present: **1** (kept in absolute-error tables; excluded from pairwise ratios -- see rule below).
