+$\Y\in\R^{n\times q}$ a centered response matrix.  A strict linear spectral
+operator $\A_b\in\R^{p\times p}$ acts on row spectra as
 \begin{equation}
-  \X_b = \X \A_b\transpose .
+  \X_b = \X\A_b\transpose .
