+trials each and produced 36 complete three-seed datasets; the observed total
+time across successful rows is 162.4 h, with median per-run total time
+984.90 s.  Ridge-HPO used ten trials per combination and produced 35 complete
+datasets; the observed total is 184.1 h, with median per-run total time
