+manuscript tables and figures were generated from local result workspaces by
+\texttt{paper\_aom/review/aggregate\_stats.py},
+\texttt{paper\_aom/review/selector\_diagnostics.py} and
+\texttt{paper\_aom/review/build\_paper\_figures.py}.  The v3 evidence summary
+is stored in \texttt{paper\_aom/review/v3\_stats.md}; the cohort manifest is
+\texttt{paper\_aom/review/cohort\_manifest.csv}; the long-form per-dataset
