+with PLS-HPO (median ratio 1.002, 15 wins), while strict compact AOM-PLS is
+slightly favourable at the median (0.990, 19 wins).  This shows that a full
+cartesian HPO campaign can recover part of the preprocessing advantage, but it
+does so at a much larger compute cost and on a reduced completed subset.
 
