+bank are not concentrated in one family; they occur when the default wider
+bank or a branch correction better matches the validation split.  Quantitatively,
+compact AOM-PLS beats the production default on 34 of 53 paired datasets, and
+strict compact AOM-PLS beats the ASLS branch on 23 of 53 datasets.  The ASLS
+branch is therefore useful but not universally dominant.
 
