-Identity & $I$ & Always included; recovers the standard model.\\
-Smoothing & Savitzky--Golay smoothing & Strict linear operator.\\
-Derivatives & SG first and second derivatives, finite difference & Strict linear operator.\\
-Detrending & degree-1 and degree-2 trend projections & Strict linear operator when fitted inside folds.\\
-Scatter correction & SNV, MSC, EMSC & Fold-local branch preprocessing, not a fixed operator.\\
-Baseline correction & ASLS and related smoothers & Fold-local branch preprocessing, not a fixed operator.\\
-Orthogonal correction & OSC-style branches & Fold-local branch; not part of the strict AOM algebra.\\
+\code{SingleChainPLSRidge} & Top screened chain followed by PLS-Ridge &
+Fast baseline equivalent to selecting one strong chain and fitting a
+coefficient-bearing calibration.\\
+\code{HardAOMChainPLSRidge} & One greedy chain per latent component &
+Faithful chain-level AOM exploration; useful diagnostically but not promoted
+by the full benchmark.\\
+\code{SoftAOMChainPLSRidge} & Sparse non-negative chain mixture per component &
+Explores mixture routing; median results are below sparse-MKR on the full
+table.\\
+\code{SparseMultiKernelRidge} & Greedy sparse non-negative kernel mixture &
+Best FastAOM family in the benchmark; compact and supervised variants are
+both retained in the main comparison.\\
+\code{FastAOMPLSRidge} & Orchestrator over bases, chains, SVD, screening and fit &
+Entry point used by the benchmark runner.\\
 \bottomrule
 \end{tabularx}
 \end{table}
