-\section{Additional Experiments Required for a Journal Submission}
+The FastAOM implementation is validated by 54 local tests and by the four
+documented review rounds in \code{bench/AOM\_v0/FastAOM/IMPLEMENTATION\_NOTES.md}.
+The AOM-PLS reference and AOM-lib-backed wrappers are validated by the local
+unit and parity tests listed in Table~\ref{tab:sup_software}.  AOM-Ridge is
+distributed as research code under \code{bench/AOM\_v0/Ridge}.
 
