+For centered $\X$ and $\Y$, standard PLS can be written with weights
+$\mathbf W$, loadings $\mathbf P$ and response loadings $\mathbf Q$:
+\begin{equation}
+  \B=\mathbf W(\mathbf P\transpose\mathbf W)^+\mathbf Q\transpose .
+\end{equation}
