-\subsection{Model selection}
+All preprocessing and hyperparameter choices are made inside the calibration
+set.  External test sets are preserved from source data when available; when
+not available, deterministic SPXY or stratified splits are used
+\citep{kennard1969computer,galvao2005method}.  RMSEP is the primary
+regression metric.  Because response scales differ across traits, aggregate
+comparisons use paired RMSEP ratios.  Classification uses balanced accuracy.
