-\section{AOM-Ridge Result Separation}
+AOM-PLS dataset-level RMSEP rankings are highly correlated across seeds:
+mean seed-pair Spearman correlations are 0.996--1.000 for the main variants.
+The nonzero median seed CV for compact AOM variants reflects internal
+selection changes, and 18 datasets change the winning member of the
+AOM-PLS/PLS family across seeds.  The top5 AOM-Ridge rows are deterministic
+on the recorded split/random-state representation in this workspace, so their
+seed-pair correlations are 1.000 and the family winner does not change.
+FastAOM is deterministic for a fixed train/test split and configuration; its
+seed0 evidence should therefore be read as chain-space evidence rather than
+split-resampling evidence.
 
