+They are therefore not promoted as regression methods.  Hard-chain and
+soft-chain FastAOM variants are valuable exploration tools, but the main
+results favour sparse MKR and single-chain compact models.  Local AOM-Ridge is
+fast but not competitive with Ridge-HPO on the current overlap.
 
